### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@email = testuser@example.com
@password = SecurePass123!

### 1. Register a new user (Status: 201 Created)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "phone_number": "+1234567890",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Store Token from Registration
@authToken = {{register.response.body.access_token}}

### 2. Login with that user (Status: 200 OK)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Get /auth/me with Bearer token (Status: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Create an event with Bearer token (Status: 201 Created)
# @name createEvent
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Townhall Meeting",
  "description": "Quarterly community townhall broadcast",
  "scheduled_start": "2026-10-01T15:00:00Z"
}

### Store Created Event ID
@eventId = {{createEvent.response.body.id}}

### 5. List all events (Status: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Get single event by id (Status: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Join an event (Status: 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Try joining the same event twice (Status: 200 OK, returns existing record without duplicating)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Try registering with duplicate email (Status: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Duplicate",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "phone_number": "+1234567890",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 10. Try logging in with wrong password (Status: 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "WrongPassword999!"
}

### 11. Try accessing /events without a token (Status: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### 12. Generate LiveKit token for joined event (Status: 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/token
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
